	(text "SW_SENSE (IO4): LATCH_RTN via R9 1k, internal pull-up. LOW = SW2 ON, HIGH = SW2 OFF.\nUSB_SENSE (IO5, ADC1_CH4): VIN / 2. USB ~4.6 V -> ~2.3 V; battery (VBAT-0.3) -> ~1.9-2.0 V; off -> 0 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "120dc975-74a0-424f-924f-119700087a2e")
	)
	(text "D4/D5 1N4148W (low leakage, IR 25 nA @20 V): D5 is reverse-biased by VBAT when the ESP32 is off, so leakage must stay far below 1 uA (R4 100k).\nJ4 = battery wires soldered to pads (no connector)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "29df73a5-f761-4a60-b2cb-fd3aab85d79e")
	)
	(text "SW2: A side (pin1, GND) = ON. SW2 only switches the latch return, not the load current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "41e9694b-cdf7-4361-bdf9-4199415de19d")
	)
	(text "R3 5.1k: Ichg = 1000V/5.1k = 196 mA (400 mAh protected LiPo, 0.5C). All R/C are 0805 (user's kit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "580751f6-fb12-45cf-8603-6a9709bed580")
	)
	(text "C4 22uF / R4 100k holds ~1 s after a short press; firmware sets IO2 high at boot, low to power off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a3f87aa1-099e-4819-aa9b-eea9ba1f4161")
	)
	(text "Power latch: SW2 ON + SW1 press (or PWR_HOLD = IO2 high) pulls Q1 gate low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a6725723-326b-4c0a-a78f-534ceac82fb5")
	)
	(text "VBAT_SENSE = VBAT_SW / 2 on IO1 (ADC1_CH0). SW1 is still read on IO7 (internal pull-up, LOW = pressed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "edfda7d7-6e11-4722-a608-7e76aa6e5964")
	)
